  "title": "Connection to Grid of a 10 MW Solar Project in Italy",
  "summary": "Ellomay Capital Ltd. (the “Company”) hereby updates that on July 30, 2026, the 10 MW solar facility constructed by Ellomay Solar Italy Fifteen S.r.l (an Italian private company 51% held by the Company), was successfully connected to the Italian national grid and commenced production of energy. The solar facility held by Ellomay Solar Italy Fifteen […]",
